   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Can I bother you for a moment?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "Now that the funeral is over,[n]it feels like a small burden has[n]been lifted from my shoulders.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This must be tough...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_002_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Are you all right?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "It is... but I'm OK.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Haru",
   "en": "I am.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
